    "evidence": "Keyboard coverage and visible focus indicators pass for all expected controls; no touch-target violations or arena viewport overflow were measured; reduced-motion mode showed zero changed elements. However, WCAG contrast remains unproven: axe marked color contrast serious/incomplete for 75–83 arena nodes and 14–26 header nodes. Tablet/mobile headers also clip 21–27 navigation descendants, with content extending to 1343px/1214px despite 768px/390px viewports.",
